**Summary:** Combined all 16 JSON-converted functions from `guides/8/all.R/` into `guides/8_kernsmooth/r2py_kernsmooth/__init__.py`. Deduplicated/merged imports (stdlib → third-party → local), dropped intra-file self-referential imports like `from .linbin import linbin` since those functions now live in the same module and call each other by bare name, and preserved the existing `__all__` list (which already matched the 14 public functions; `.onAttach`/`.onUnload` map to private `on_attach`/`on_unload` helpers, left unexported like their R dot-prefixed originals).

